>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.\n…”</p>","file":"ch1/field-homomorphisms.html"}